      "body": "Use DeepGEMM config deduplication from this PR: https://github.com/sgl-project/DeepGEMM/pull/58\r\nThis reduces start time \r\nfrom 6:30 to 6:10 on B200 with DeepSeek-V3.2\r\nand from 10:00 to 2:00 on B200 with a custom MOE model\r\n\r\nWe use the existing deduplication mechanism from DeepGEMM, which we exposed to Python API so it can be used in SGLang. The speed-up comes from removing config copies during warmup.\r\n\r\nRelated PR: https://github.com/sgl-project/DeepGEMM/pull/58\r\nRelated issue: https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepGEMM/issues/196\r\n\r\nTODO: If DeepGEMM PR gets merged, also update dependencies when new release comes out\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\r\n---\r\n### CI States\r\n\r\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #29575633395](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/29575633395)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\r\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #29575633226](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/29575633226)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\r\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
